            <div xml:id="d391">

                <pb facs="0487" n="321" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg321"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 818.00/123</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Hale </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1917-04-05T17:00:00-05:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">April 5, 1917—5 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Your April 2, 4 p.m. Department has been informed by other sources that Tinoco
                    was elected President of Costa Rica. This is not clear from your telegram.
                    Please report immediately by cable to Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
